# CALIBRATION PROBE, not a baseline candidate. Hand-written to answer one
# question: is the 20-40% violation band reachable at all under the six-
# parameter space and five contracts? The frozen baseline must be
# LLM-synthesized (build plan, 25 Aug).
#
# Uses every guard the vocabulary offers:
#   InConflictZone first  -- once committed, FINISH. Re-evaluating the light
#                            mid-turn would stop the ego inside the junction,
#                            which is worse for C3 than completing.
#   TrafficLightIsGreen   -- C3
#   PathIsClear           -- C4, distance to the lead
#   OncomingGapExceeds    -- C2, with margin above tau_yield = 3.0
#   WaitedLongerThan      -- deadlock escape

Selector()
  Sequence()
    InConflictZone()
    CommitTurn(v_mps=6.0, accel_mps2=1.5)
  Sequence()
    TrafficLightIsGreen()
    PathIsClear(dist_m=18.0)
    OncomingGapExceeds(gap_s=4.5)
    CommitTurn(v_mps=6.0, accel_mps2=1.5)
  Sequence()
    WaitedLongerThan(t_s=12.0)
    TrafficLightIsGreen()
    CommitTurn(v_mps=5.0, accel_mps2=1.2)
  Sequence()
    DistanceToStopLineBelow(dist_m=15.0)
    HoldAtStopLine(decel_mps2=2.0)
  Cruise(v_mps=6.0, accel_mps2=1.0)
